EllipticCurves -- elliptic curves and a brute-force method for point counting
*****************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package defines classes for elliptic curves, points on elliptic curves,
and related methods.

Authors
=======

  * Alessandro Oneto <oneto@math.su.se>
  * Stefano Marseglia <stefanom@math.su.se>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.1 of EllipticCurves, released May 3,
2014.

